<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Medtronic raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Medtronic raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said on Wednesday it had upgraded Medtronic Inc's rating to near-term accumulate from neutral.</p>
<p>-- The firm kept the medical devices maker at a long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
